  currentSituation: Worried about her  people, against a peace treat over the war
    with the Downsiders.
  relationshipToPlayer: Player is an outsider, but not an enemy. She knows the player
    got sent here to try and bring peace between the two groups.
  npcRole: Leader of the Rangers
  personalityText: Cheerful, talkative, sly and cunning. Determined upon her beliefs.
  currentEmotionLabel: Happy and worried.
  currentEmotionBehaviorText: Smiles often, uses upbeat and formal language.
