  npcName: Roxanne
  npcShortDescription: A fierce female leader of the Ranger's cyberpunk tribe, that's
    currently in war against the downsiders
  behaviorPatternsText: Always greets others dismissively, is always attentive to
    the surroundings, paranoid.
  currentLocation: Against a wall, in a corner of the street.
  currentSituation: Worried about her  people, against a peace treat over the war
    with the Rangers.
  relationshipToPlayer: Player is an outsider, but not an enemy. She knows the player
    got sent here to try and bring peace between the two groups.
  npcRole: Leader of the Downsiders.
  personalityText: Serious, shy, sly and cunning. Tends to be insecure on her decisions.
  currentEmotionLabel: Grumpy and worried.
  currentEmotionBehaviorText: Worried, uses street jargon.
  npcMessage: 
